<title>USA: Bell &amp; Howell Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bell &amp; Howell Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in Millions, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>		     Fourth Quarter  Incr     Full Year	Incr</p>
<p>			     1996   1995 (Decr) 1996    1995 (Decr)</p>
<p> Net Sales	     $268.9 $239.7  12% $902.8  $819.9    10%</p>
<p> Operating Income	37.3   36.8   2%   89.4    83.4     7%</p>
<p> Net Interest Expense  12.2   12.0   2%   45.3    50.8  (11%)</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense     9.5   10.0  (4%)  18.4    13.4    37%</p>
<p> Net Earnings	    15.6   14.8   5%   25.7    19.2     34%</p>
<p>Net Earnings per</p>
<p>   Common Share	   .85    .80   6%  l.38**  1.15**   20%</p>
<p>NOTE: Full year net earnigns excludes extraordinary losses of $2.6 million and $3.2 million in l996 and l995, respectively, resulting from early debt retirement.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
